To maintain this code properly, the following three repositories have to be
tracked for changes (maintenance details below):

- https://github.com/mattn/go-sqlite
- https://github.com/sqlcipher/sqlcipher
- https://github.com/openssl/openssl


Update code from https://github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3
----------------------------------------------------

Current release: v1.14.5

Use ./track_go-sqlite3.sh


Update code from https://github.com/sqlcipher/sqlcipher
-------------------------------------------------------

Current release: v4.17.0

Execute:
./configure --with-tempstore=yes --fts5 \\
  CFLAGS='-DSQLITE_HAS_CODEC -DSQLITE_EXTRA_INIT=sqlcipher_extra_init -DSQLITE_EXTRA_SHUTDOWN=sqlcipher_extra_shutdown' \\
  LDFLAGS='-lcrypto'
make sqlite3.c

Track files:
sqlite3.h
sqlite3.c


SQLCipher uses OpenSSL through the amalgamation; the Go package links it with
`-lcrypto`. Keep the compiler flags in `flags.go` synchronized with SQLCipher's
current build requirements.
